          "type": "h2",
          "text": "OTHER TOOLS WERE NOT MADE FOR BANGLA."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "I dictate a lot, in English and in Bangla. Every voice typing app I tried got my Bangla wrong. So I tested 13 speech engines on 110 Bangla recordings and built Shobdo on the ones that did best."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Khalid Farhan"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Whisper large-v3-turbo, the model most dictation apps run"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "42 wrong letters in 100"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Shobdo offline, on your computer"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "10 wrong letters in 100"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Shobdo cloud, with Google Gemini"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "8 wrong letters in 100"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Our test, October 2026: 110 clips of read Bangla, Bangladeshi phone recordings and Bangla mixed with English. Lower is better."
        }
      ]
    },
